---
description: Rust domain and hexagonal boundaries
globs: "crates/**/*.rs,services/api/**/*.rs"
alwaysApply: false
---
Do not import network, UI, SQL or provider-specific crates from `sovir-domain`. Domain models have no I/O; application services depend on ports. Adapters implement ports and hold SDK dependencies. Use deterministic Clock/Test doubles and meaningful errors. Add unit and contract tests. ADR required to change ports or persist sensitive content.
